<h1>Align to Plane</h1>
<hr align="left" width="100.526%" size="5" class="whs3">
<p><span lang="EN-GB">This command is accessible from</span> <b><i style="font-style:normal; font-weight:normal;"><span class="Path" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>View &gt; Custom Views &gt; Align to Plane</b></span> <span class="Path" style="font-style:normal; font-weight:normal;">or by pressing</span> <span class="Path" style="font-style:normal; font-weight:bold;"><b>Shift + Alt + V</b></span></i></b><span lang="EN-GB">.</span></p>
<p class="Description"><b><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Description: Align View</b></span></b> <span lang="EN-GB">command aligns view direction orthogonal to the selected datum plane or plane reducible datum entity (cylinder, circle, cone, slots).</span></p>
